<title>USA: Chateau to review revised offer.</title>
<headline>Chateau to review revised offer.</headline>
<dateline>CLINTON TOWNSHIP, Mich. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chateau Properties Inc said Thursday it received a revised proposal from Manufactured Home Communitiies Inc and that it will carefully review the proposal.</p>
<p>Manufactured Home Communities said it remains committed to acquiring Chateau. The revised proposal offers Chateau shareholders and Operating Partnership Unit holders $26 cash or a convertible preferred security.</p>
</text>
